---
description: SCSS token usage — ds mixin API, no hardcoded colors
globs: "**/*.scss"
alwaysApply: false
---

# styles

```scss
@use 'ds' as ds;
```

- Colors/spacing/radius/type/z-index/duration: `var(--app-*)` or local `--_*` slots only.
- Forbidden outside `design-system/tokens`: hex, named colors, `rgb/rgba/hsl`, raw px on spacing/radius/font-size, hardcoded font-family.
- Class names: BEM-ish kebab-case (`block__element--modifier`).
- includePaths already point at `libs/design-system/tokens/src/styles` — do not invent parallel token files in features.
- Do not disable Stylelint color rules to ship shortcuts.
